  Slug: thaumaturge
  DisplayName: Thaumaturge
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/class.svg
  Description: "The world is full of the unexplainable: ancient magic, dead gods,
    and even stranger things. In response, you've scavenged the best parts of every
    magical tradition and built up a collection of esoterica\u2014a broken holy relic
    here, a sprig of mistletoe there\u2014that you can use to best any creature by
    exploiting their weaknesses and vulnerabilities. The mystic implement you carry
    is both badge and weapon, its symbolic weight helping you bargain with and subdue
    the supernatural. Every path to power has its restrictions and costs, but you
    turn them all to your advantage. You're a thaumaturge, and you work wonders.
    Thaumaturge"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Dark Archive
